
### Create payment (replace customerID and merchantID with existing IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "merchantID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "amount": 750.00,
  "currency": "MAD",
  "method": "CARD"
}

### Process a CARD payment (replace with the payment ID returned by Create payment)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/process
Accept: application/json

### Create an over-limit WALLET payment (replace customerID and merchantID with existing IDs)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "merchantID": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
  "amount": 6000.00,
  "currency": "MAD",
  "method": "WALLET"
}

### Process the over-limit WALLET payment (replace with its payment ID; expect FAILED result)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004/process
Accept: application/json

### Try to process an already processed payment again (replace with its payment ID; expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/process
Accept: application/json

### Process a payment ID that does not exist (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/process
Accept: application/json
